  "description": "Strength • Build • Performance • Geometry • Build Kits • Technical Specs\n\nAt the heart of Calfee Design is a group of avid mountain bikers, so it was only a matter of time before we combined our passion and knowledge to create a tandem worthy of the trails. Our Plus Mountain is the flagship durable, off-road design that can tackle everything from gnarly single track to backcountry adventures. The Tetra Plus Mountain sacrifices weight in favor of durability and capability.\n\nThe Tetra Plus Mountain Tandem is compatible with 27.5 plus and 29 inch wheel sizes, rigid or suspension forks, and custom sizing to offer versatility to the rider. This all-mountain machine utilizes a larger tire platform to create a confidence inspiring build that handles just like your mountain bike at home.\n\nOur wrapped lug design provides a level of comfort and compliance that procures an astounding ride quality that few other bikes can deliver. Through more than 30 years of research, development, and advancements in the carbon bicycle industry, we’ve perfected our unique manufacturing process to develop the perfect tailored ride for every tandem team.\n\nOur expert-selected build kits utilize your favorite components from the likes of SRAM, Shimano, Campagnolo, and more to deliver a well rounded package while eliminating the guess work related to tandem construction and specifications. Each unique build kit is thoroughly tested to ensure maximum reliability and performance. See available build kits for this model.",
